Package: kiyoshi-packages-repo
Version: 1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: debconf (>= 1.5), apt
Maintainer: Kiyoshi Spreclerg <kiyoshi_pip@protonmail.com>
Description: kiyoshi-packages apt repository (key and sources)
 Adds the kiyoshi-packages apt repository to this system: installs its signing
 key and writes the apt source for this system's release (Ubuntu 22.04/24.04,
 Debian 12/13, Devuan 5/6). Removing the package removes both.
 .
 The XLibre channel (none, stable or beta) is asked on install and can be
 changed with: sudo dpkg-reconfigure kiyoshi-packages-repo
